OL,3,ATwo dead after car hits group of
OL,4,Apedestrians
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died and four have been
OL,7,Fseriously injured after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a group of people in Doncaster.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to White Rose Way when a
OL,12,Fblack Mitsubishi L200 hit a group of
OL,13,Fpedestrians at 11:00 BST on Sunday,
OL,14,Fbefore hitting a black Audi and silver
OL,15,FBMW on the opposite carriageway.
OL,17,FThe force said two of the pedestrians
OL,18,Fhad died at the scene while four other
OL,19,Fpeople were taken to hospital with
OL,20,Fserious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
